      "value": "@{620277fff0b78d647651d2cf|full_name} I checked just now and none of my worlds have discords cdn whitelisted for videos. On the world ID in question, the \"Video Player Allowed Domains\" is perfectly clean.\n\nI don't have anything that uses the string loader, just a ProTV video player, and a few imagepads that use Image Loading. \n\nTo test your point of view where the world ID matters, would removing the world ID from the Pipeline manager be sufficient? I figure I can delete the world ID, then build and test, and see if I can play stuff from discord or elsewhere.",
